# ctrim_app Firebase

- All Firestore reads/writes through `lib/firebase/db_managers/`
- Cloud Functions via `functions_manager.dart`
- `cloud_firestore` types only in `firebase/` and `models/`

Info content: `InfoRepository` (`lib/utility/info_repository.dart`) + `info_db_manager.dart` for churches, testimonials, ctrim_info. `assets/info/` JSON is legacy seed/reference only.

Admin catalogs: `user_tags` / `user_locations` via their DB managers; users store tag IDs and location **names**. Writes require `everyone.isAreaAdmin` (or `isAdmin`); UI uses `User.canManageVolunteers` + `RoleAccessGate`. Post content tags: `post_tags` via `PostTagDBManager`; posts/templates store `TagIDs`; optional `StreamKind` drives location-aware FCM streams (`docs/post-tags-notification-streams.md`). Period parents: `IsPeriodParent` on supplemental metadata (+ head denorm); editable `ParentID` syncs `ChildrenIDs` via `EventSupplementalDBManager.syncChildrenLinkage` (`docs/cell-groups.md` Phase 0.5). Placeholder users: `IsPlaceholder` + `CreatedByUserID` on `users`; mint/link via CFs `create_placeholder_user` / `link_user_auth` (do not widen client `users` create); creator may name-only update while still a placeholder (`docs/cell-groups.md` Phase 0.75). Cell groups: `cell_groups/{id}` head (guest-readable) + `supplemental/roster` (signed-in read; leaders via `LeaderAuthIds` or area admin write); `CellGroupIDs` on event head/metadata/templates mirror `TagIDs` (`docs/cell-groups.md` Phase 1). `EveryoneDBManager.setAsUser` syncs `isUser` / `isLeader` / `isAreaAdmin` onto `everyone/{authID}`.
